{
  "abstract": "A Lean 4 proof of Conjecture 96 of Written on the Wall II (Graffiti.pc): every connected graph G on at least two vertices satisfies α(G) ≤ 1 + min_v disteven(v)·(max_v l(v) − 1), where disteven(v) is the number of vertices at even distance from v and l(v) is the independence number of the neighbourhood of v. The proof gives the stronger bound α(G) ≤ 1 + disteven(v)·(L − 1) for every vertex v, which is sharp for stars.",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Rhett (@v3ai)"
    }
  ],
